          "slotIds": [
            "limits-content"
          ],
          "intent": "Explain the supporting idea in concise language.",
          "content": "Why atomic? Separate checks can both pass before either write.\nScope: one document; no deletion. This does not merge edits or make\nmulti-document changes atomic. A lost success response can look like\na later conflict: revision checks alone do not deduplicate requests.",
